{"3819020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DEADBOOT", "steam_appid": 3819020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/dd65931b8d0a7ae37e90d9532ac3eaf9.avif?t=1785771111\" width=611 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/218bd6a6e4427c70db7e4c8158f405a7.poster.avif?t=1785771111\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/218bd6a6e4427c70db7e4c8158f405a7.webm?t=1785771111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/218bd6a6e4427c70db7e4c8158f405a7.mp4?t=1785771111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death isn't the end. Restart your climb, discover new upgrades, and experiment with different builds as you fight your way back through the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/42c54bc15f26674afaf0f4f352e3b3c5.avif?t=1785771111\" width=611 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/3211144dfa1fb29e4ee86e38b8e85851.poster.avif?t=1785771111\" width=610 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/3211144dfa1fb29e4ee86e38b8e85851.webm?t=1